  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 209.03 Issuance and Publication of Declaratory Rulings. Declaratory rulings issued by the department shall be filed on the day of issue with the director of legislative services in accordance with RSA 541-A:16, II (b), and edited subject to the requirements of RSA 21-J:14.\n\nSource. #1668, eff 11-18-80; ss by #2115-a, eff 8-10-82; ss by #2820, eff 8-17-84; ss by #4060, eff 5-29-86, EXPIRED: 5-29-92\n\nNew. #5423, eff 6-23-92; ss by #6749, eff 5-19-98, EXPIRED: 5-19-06\n\nNew. #8658-A, eff 6-13-06; ss by #11185-A, eff 9-20-16",
